{"unit_id":"Makima667__dsh-smart-profile#feature-1","repo":"Makima667/dsh-smart-profile","commit":"a418629dd812cb10be7404f937ede5b4077975ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-profile 的功能「项目扫描」：读取常见 manifest、锁文件和指定配置文件，汇总项目语言、框架、数据库及基础设施信号，并给出证据。通过扫描工具或 CLI scan 命令触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/scan.js:17-33","lib/scan.js:66-89"]}
