{"unit_id":"Makima667__dsh-smart-profile#feature-3","repo":"Makima667/dsh-smart-profile","commit":"a418629dd812cb10be7404f937ede5b4077975ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-profile 的功能「任务能力裁剪」：根据任务描述中的关键词选择项目相关能力，并在编码任务中补入项目运行时能力。通过 compose 命令或 smart_profile_compose 工具提供输入任务以生成组合结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/compose.js:1-26","index.js:19"]}
